This product is a Rust port of Laya (https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya),
Copyright the Laya authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The sequence format, decision head, calibration and routing logic are ported
from that project. The model checkpoints it loads (convaiinnovations/laya on
the Hugging Face Hub) are published by the same authors under the same licence
and are not redistributed here.

The ModernBERT backbone implementation comes from candle-transformers
(https://github.com/huggingface/candle), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 / MIT.
